WEBVTT

01:36.915 --> 01:40.235
[Episode 10]

01:40.235 --> 01:42.235
I've checked with our informant
in the Beggar Gang.

01:42.235 --> 01:46.275
Today, Shao Ji Zu is drinking
on the second floor of the Baihua Tavern.

01:46.275 --> 01:47.655
I heard from Xiao Tang

01:47.655 --> 01:49.088
that whenever Shao Ji Zu is frustrated,

01:49.088 --> 01:50.655
he goes there to drink.

01:50.655 --> 01:54.475
It seems you have truly broken his heart.

01:54.475 --> 01:55.655
Can you get the token?

01:55.655 --> 01:57.455
How sure?

01:57.455 --> 01:59.729
Just wait and see.

02:02.075 --> 02:03.924
- Waiter.
- Coming.

02:05.793 --> 02:07.075
This is for the alcohol.

02:07.075 --> 02:08.811
We pay for him.

02:30.228 --> 02:31.628
I was wondering who it was.

02:31.628 --> 02:33.628
So much temper and so much wealth,

02:33.628 --> 02:35.495
booking the entire second floor.

02:35.495 --> 02:37.828
So it's Commander Shao.

02:37.828 --> 02:39.128
Get out.

02:39.128 --> 02:40.194
What's the rush?

02:40.194 --> 02:41.694
We're all here to drink,

02:41.694 --> 02:43.194
not to fight.

02:43.194 --> 02:44.194
Besides,

02:44.194 --> 02:46.495
all of you together

02:46.495 --> 02:48.540
still couldn't beat me.

02:53.395 --> 02:54.995
Commander Shao, don't you want to know

02:54.995 --> 02:57.601
why I've come here?

03:19.728 --> 03:22.328
Did Zhan Zhao send you

03:22.328 --> 03:23.995
to fish for information from me?

03:23.995 --> 03:25.467
Him?

03:26.328 --> 03:28.915
He's not worthy of giving me orders.

03:29.961 --> 03:31.728
I'll get straight to the point.

03:31.728 --> 03:33.161
Commander Shao,

03:33.161 --> 03:35.395
regarding what you're planning,

03:35.395 --> 03:37.694
could you let Five Rats

03:37.694 --> 03:40.363
have a piece of the action?

03:40.995 --> 03:42.228
You know.

03:42.228 --> 03:43.728
We, the Five Rats of Xiankong Island,

03:43.728 --> 03:45.395
may have a reputation,

03:45.395 --> 03:48.128
but we're just outlaws of the marsh.

03:48.128 --> 03:49.395
But look at Zhan Zhao.

03:49.395 --> 03:50.428
At Yaowu House,

03:50.428 --> 03:51.995
with his Three Skills and Six Feats,

03:51.995 --> 03:54.295
he earned the title of "Imperial Cat"
from His Majesty.

03:54.295 --> 03:55.761
He's a fourth-rank official now.

03:55.761 --> 03:57.328
His career has soared ever since.

03:57.328 --> 04:00.728
They all sneer at him

04:00.728 --> 04:03.361
for latching onto the powerful.

04:03.361 --> 04:06.094
Yet every one of them dreams of being Zhan Zhao

04:06.094 --> 04:08.194
rich, famous, and above it all.

04:08.194 --> 04:09.328
What?

04:09.328 --> 04:11.728
You want to dip your hands in politics?

04:11.728 --> 04:13.428
To be honest,

04:13.428 --> 04:17.040
I've saved Zhan Zhao many times
just to get close to him,

04:17.040 --> 04:19.028
so he could show Five Rats a way.

04:19.028 --> 04:20.194
But as for Zhan Zhao,

04:20.194 --> 04:21.828
I don't know if he's dull or stubborn.

04:21.828 --> 04:24.228
He keeps insisting on

04:24.228 --> 04:25.995
"seeking justice."

04:25.995 --> 04:27.128
To tell you the truth,

04:27.128 --> 04:29.328
I don't even know Liu Hong Yi.

04:29.328 --> 04:31.694
Yet I was chased along with him,

04:31.694 --> 04:33.328
which even affected Xiankong Island.

04:33.328 --> 04:36.828
My brothers almost lost their lives for that.

04:36.828 --> 04:38.995
You're absolutely right.

04:38.995 --> 04:42.360
That Zhan Zhao is just a hypocritical poser.

04:42.360 --> 04:44.128
He only cares about his own gain

04:44.128 --> 04:46.995
while letting others fight his battles.

04:46.995 --> 04:49.295
Exactly!

04:49.295 --> 04:50.955
A few days ago,

04:50.955 --> 04:53.295
for my future, I thought I'd just help him out.

04:53.295 --> 04:55.095
But now I've realized the truth.

04:55.095 --> 04:56.635
I do all the dirty work,

04:56.635 --> 04:58.481
while he gets all the credit.

04:58.481 --> 05:01.715
People say he's chivalrous.
He serves the realm and people.

05:01.715 --> 05:02.715
But me?

05:02.715 --> 05:04.881
I almost offended the officials for him

05:04.881 --> 05:06.651
and nearly lost my life.

05:08.155 --> 05:10.074
Actually,

05:10.074 --> 05:12.636
if you want to join the government,

05:12.636 --> 05:15.401
Zhan Zhao isn't the only way.

05:18.601 --> 05:20.135
Commander Shao,

05:20.135 --> 05:21.635
you are a magnanimous man.

05:21.635 --> 05:22.868
I apologize

05:22.868 --> 05:25.268
for deceiving and kidnapping you before.

05:25.268 --> 05:27.475
Please accept my apologies.

05:33.461 --> 05:36.535
As for what you seek,

05:36.535 --> 05:38.497
I can agree to it.

05:39.468 --> 05:41.947
But what can you give me in return?

05:44.568 --> 05:47.181
Zhan Zhao trusts me for now.

05:47.834 --> 05:50.835
I'll feed you his movements on the case.

05:50.835 --> 05:52.585
What do you say?

06:13.035 --> 06:15.328
Why are all of you standing? Sit!

06:15.328 --> 06:18.575
Let's drink together. We're on the same side.

06:37.194 --> 06:41.394
If you want to win back Ling Long,

06:41.394 --> 06:43.228
you must first let her see

06:43.228 --> 06:45.428
Zhan Zhao's true colors

06:45.428 --> 06:48.250
as a fame-seeking and fickle man.

06:52.495 --> 06:54.495
Bai Yu Tang badmouthed me, right?

06:54.495 --> 06:56.520
What did he say?

06:58.595 --> 07:00.194
He said

07:00.194 --> 07:01.828
you are

07:01.828 --> 07:03.428
foolish and stubborn,

07:03.428 --> 07:05.620
and...

07:06.194 --> 07:08.470
fickle.

07:14.928 --> 07:17.120
I lied to you about being Ding Zhao Hui

07:17.120 --> 07:19.440
not without reason.

07:21.528 --> 07:24.529
Xiankong Island and the Ding family
are old friends.

07:24.529 --> 07:26.828
I know a great deal about

07:26.828 --> 07:28.877
Zhan Zhao and the Ding family.

07:36.095 --> 07:40.295
He was actually engaged to their daughter.

07:40.295 --> 07:41.795
But now that he'd met Miss Huo,

07:41.795 --> 07:44.495
he'd cast that Ding girl out of his mind.

07:44.495 --> 07:45.595
Furthermore,

07:45.595 --> 07:47.595
when he visited Xiankong Island,

07:47.595 --> 07:50.591
he actually took the opportunity to...

07:55.728 --> 07:56.961
What?

07:56.961 --> 07:58.428
What else did he say about me?

07:58.428 --> 08:00.228
He was just giving some examples

08:00.228 --> 08:01.928
to prove that you are

08:01.928 --> 08:04.056
fickle.

08:05.295 --> 08:07.093
What examples?

08:08.894 --> 08:11.828
He said you harassed the maid
on Xiankong Island.

08:11.828 --> 08:14.161
That you flirted with

08:14.161 --> 08:16.533
every attractive woman on the island.

08:26.894 --> 08:29.761
A good man needs no bride to prove his worth.

08:29.761 --> 08:31.835
You are handsome and talented.

08:31.835 --> 08:34.294
Why be so obsessed with Huo Ling Long?

08:34.294 --> 08:36.095
What makes her so special to you?

08:36.095 --> 08:38.435
It's not like she's a goddess.

08:42.640 --> 08:44.680
Something even more absurd?

08:47.528 --> 08:49.228
Now he's talking about me.

08:49.228 --> 08:50.428
He said

08:50.428 --> 08:52.095
that Shao Ji Zu

08:52.095 --> 08:55.328
is handsome and talented.

08:55.328 --> 08:56.394
As for me,

08:56.394 --> 08:57.596
my looks are average,

08:57.596 --> 09:00.040
but my temper is anything but.

09:00.828 --> 09:04.867
He said he didn't get why Shao Ji Zu
asked my father for our marriage.

09:09.161 --> 09:11.428
No more danger finds him here. Let's go.

09:11.428 --> 09:12.894
When you settle the bill,

09:12.894 --> 09:15.561
compensate the shopkeeper for the cup.

09:18.475 --> 09:21.661
Today, I'll let Zhan Zhao know...

09:23.695 --> 09:25.761
Stealing one's wife

09:25.761 --> 09:27.995
is an unforgivable feud.

09:27.995 --> 09:33.072
I'll make Zhan Zhao regret stealing my lover!

09:34.728 --> 09:36.396
Brother Shao,

09:36.961 --> 09:39.894
that's a bit biased.

09:39.894 --> 09:42.794
Isn't Miss Huo the one who changed?

09:42.794 --> 09:44.495
If you want revenge,

09:44.495 --> 09:46.995
you should take it out on her.

09:46.995 --> 09:49.761
What can I do to her?

09:49.761 --> 09:55.075
What can I do to Ling Long?
I wouldn't lay a hand on her.

10:02.228 --> 10:04.371
I heard

10:04.995 --> 10:07.555
there's a great place around here

10:09.028 --> 10:11.521
called Zhongxiao Pavilion.

10:12.628 --> 10:14.195
It's full of beauties.

10:14.195 --> 10:15.915
Just bring two of them back,

10:15.915 --> 10:17.394
and make Huo Ling Long feel bad.

10:17.394 --> 10:19.728
You're insulting me.

10:19.728 --> 10:23.628
You're insulting my deep love for her.

10:23.628 --> 10:26.459
I'm not insulting your love.

10:28.561 --> 10:30.428
Then come with me

10:30.428 --> 10:32.394
and let me have some fun.

10:32.394 --> 10:34.361
Stop it.

10:34.361 --> 10:37.695
I'll get angry if you say more about it.

10:37.695 --> 10:39.361
If you want to go there,

10:39.361 --> 10:41.528
go by yourself.

10:41.528 --> 10:43.701
Listen.

10:44.394 --> 10:46.428
Right now,

10:46.428 --> 10:51.174
I have no interest in those common and vulgar.

10:53.915 --> 10:56.907
Tian...

10:59.628 --> 11:01.570
Brother Shao,

11:04.695 --> 11:07.420
then I'll go by myself.

11:09.761 --> 11:13.195
That's you for you, Commander Shao.

11:13.195 --> 11:15.685
So devoted.

11:22.328 --> 11:24.561
What a fierce look.

11:24.561 --> 11:27.128
We're all friends. Let's drink next time.

11:27.128 --> 11:30.565
Devoted. So very devoted.

11:52.495 --> 11:54.638
Why are you here?

11:56.361 --> 11:59.695
I see. You're worried about me.

11:59.695 --> 12:01.028
Don't worry.

12:01.028 --> 12:05.128
I took a homemade miracle pill before drinking.
I won't get drunk.

12:05.128 --> 12:08.095
I could drink for three more days.

12:08.095 --> 12:10.361
But that Shao Ji Zu is a really good drinker.

12:10.361 --> 12:12.550
Luckily, I'm not the one paying.

12:15.495 --> 12:17.195
What do you mean?

12:17.195 --> 12:19.394
They say truth comes out after drinking.

12:19.394 --> 12:20.995
Were you using the alcohol

12:20.995 --> 12:23.490
to say what's really on your mind?

12:29.028 --> 12:32.028
So you hadn't left
when Shao Ji Zu and I spoke from the heart.

12:32.028 --> 12:33.811
Of course.

12:34.828 --> 12:37.040
We only left because your stories
were getting more and more false.

12:37.040 --> 12:39.528
How much did you hear?
Did you hear the part about the Ding family?

12:39.528 --> 12:42.228
I came to you because you spoke ill of me.
Why bring up the Ding family?

12:42.228 --> 12:44.195
I know you're not here
because of the Ding family part,

12:44.195 --> 12:45.228
but I just want to mention it.

12:45.228 --> 12:46.894
Is that not allowed?

12:46.894 --> 12:50.095
This time, I lied to help Zhan Zhao.

12:50.095 --> 12:54.028
If it caused misunderstanding,
I would feel quite guilty.

12:54.028 --> 12:56.761
Ding and Zhan are indeed family friends,

12:56.761 --> 12:58.695
but the part about the betrothal,

12:58.695 --> 13:00.528
I made that up.

13:00.528 --> 13:03.195
Zhan Zhao never harassed
any maids on Xiankong Island.

13:03.195 --> 13:05.547
I don't need to explain that part, right?

13:09.095 --> 13:11.028
Have you taught him a lesson?

13:11.028 --> 13:12.475
Yes.

13:12.475 --> 13:14.235
She has already given me a good scolding.

13:14.235 --> 13:16.597
I won't dare do it again.

13:18.428 --> 13:19.995
Brother Fan made you hangover soup.

13:19.995 --> 13:22.297
- Drink it before you go.
- Alright.

13:23.128 --> 13:25.095
The signal to knock on the door
at the embroidery shop's backyard...

13:25.095 --> 13:27.490
Three long knocks and two short ones.

13:28.961 --> 13:31.729
Miss Huo, it's about time. Let's go.

13:31.729 --> 13:33.353
Okay.

13:37.995 --> 13:40.794
That Rat Bai truly has a gift

13:40.794 --> 13:42.936
for weaving a tale from nothing.

13:43.528 --> 13:46.195
He got the token so easily.

13:46.195 --> 13:47.728
Perhaps,

13:47.728 --> 13:50.995
I really should learn this skill from him.

13:50.995 --> 13:52.361
When investigating cases,

13:52.361 --> 13:54.361
it would be much easier

13:54.361 --> 13:56.320
to deal with all sorts of people.

13:57.228 --> 14:01.270
That's a talent you'll never learn.

14:06.095 --> 14:07.973
Be careful.

14:14.328 --> 14:16.435
- Let's go.
- Wait.

14:16.435 --> 14:17.944
Who are you?

14:18.961 --> 14:21.161
A friend of Bai Yu Tang.

14:27.595 --> 14:29.361
I wasn't paying attention to you this morning,

14:29.361 --> 14:30.961
so I didn't recognize you.

14:30.961 --> 14:32.681
Lead the way.

14:33.894 --> 14:36.595
Where is Master Bai? Why didn't he come?

14:36.595 --> 14:38.394
Don't ask what you shouldn't ask.

14:38.394 --> 14:40.028
He's not coming.

14:40.028 --> 14:42.236
What a pity.

14:44.361 --> 14:46.028
Wait, that's not right.

14:46.028 --> 14:47.761
If Master Bai isn't coming,

14:47.761 --> 14:49.936
what about my antidote?

14:50.928 --> 14:52.080
Listen.

14:52.080 --> 14:53.628
I, Hua Chong, may not be a great fighter.

14:53.628 --> 14:56.538
But I must win back my honor as a man.

14:57.428 --> 14:58.794
If I don't get the antidote today,

14:58.794 --> 15:00.195
don't blame me for turning hostile

15:00.195 --> 15:01.654
and won't take you in.

15:10.828 --> 15:12.995
You weren't poisoned at all.

15:12.995 --> 15:15.995
It was just one of Bai Yu Tang's tricks.

15:15.995 --> 15:17.728
That's impossible.

15:17.728 --> 15:18.995
Why is it impossible?

15:18.995 --> 15:20.495
Let me ask you.

15:20.495 --> 15:22.695
When he stuffed the pill into your mouth,

15:22.695 --> 15:25.950
did he also tap you on the shoulder?

15:29.595 --> 15:33.961
He just used his inner strength
to block the meridians in your lower body.

15:33.961 --> 15:37.531
What you swallowed was just a piece of candy.

15:38.828 --> 15:41.361
It was indeed a bit sweet.

15:41.361 --> 15:42.695
But he...

15:42.695 --> 15:44.095
He tapped my upper body

15:44.095 --> 15:46.731
and could injure my lower body?

15:47.628 --> 15:48.928
Bai Yu Tang practices

15:48.928 --> 15:52.361
an evil technique from the Western Regions.

15:52.361 --> 15:56.161
He can strike from a distance
or move objects through the air.

15:56.161 --> 15:57.961
Strike from a distance?

15:57.961 --> 15:58.961
Besides,

15:58.961 --> 16:00.328
look at Bai Yu Tang.

16:00.328 --> 16:02.915
Does he look like he knows medicine?

16:04.761 --> 16:06.346
No.

16:07.695 --> 16:09.428
My Lord,

16:09.428 --> 16:11.528
such Western evil technique,

16:11.528 --> 16:14.195
do you have a way to cure it?

16:14.195 --> 16:16.361
Just slowly massage it with your inner energy.

16:16.361 --> 16:18.887
Once your lower meridians are cleared,

16:18.887 --> 16:22.392
you'll be fine.

16:26.028 --> 16:28.206
Let's go.

16:47.761 --> 16:51.169
- It's Master Hua.
- Master Hua.

17:01.328 --> 17:02.495
Enough.

17:02.495 --> 17:03.828
I know what you're going to say.

17:03.828 --> 17:06.128
I'm not allowed in, right?

17:06.128 --> 17:08.528
You snobs.

17:08.528 --> 17:09.835
Listen,

17:09.835 --> 17:12.435
it's not me who wants to enter today.

17:12.435 --> 17:15.619
It's my friend here who wants to enter.

17:18.895 --> 17:20.597
First time here?

17:21.435 --> 17:23.330
Your name.

17:24.315 --> 17:26.297
Shen Zhong Yuan.

17:27.721 --> 17:29.343
Here.

17:32.361 --> 17:34.675
Bye then.

17:34.675 --> 17:36.428
Master Shen.

17:48.228 --> 17:50.295
Change into these clothes.

18:11.873 --> 18:13.995
So tyrannical. Zhongxiao Pavilion.

18:13.995 --> 18:16.228
A simple "no entry" would have sufficed.

18:16.228 --> 18:19.810
Why trick me in and turn your weapons on me?

18:21.128 --> 18:23.728
I've long heard that
Shen Zhong Yuan's Pili Palm is incredible.

18:23.728 --> 18:25.995
It can break limbs and cripple one's skills.

18:25.995 --> 18:27.561
Those strikes were indeed formidable.

18:27.561 --> 18:29.728
If you hadn't shown mercy,

18:29.728 --> 18:32.052
I'm afraid we would be cripples by now.

18:37.161 --> 18:38.561
So you were testing me?

18:38.561 --> 18:40.228
Please don't take offense.

18:40.228 --> 18:41.628
We

18:41.628 --> 18:44.032
were only following orders.

18:47.495 --> 18:48.995
So the test is over.

18:48.995 --> 18:50.495
Did I pass?

18:50.495 --> 18:52.028
Please change your clothes.

18:52.028 --> 18:53.594
Go down from here.

18:53.594 --> 18:57.154
Remember the password tonight.
"The water falls, the stone shows".

20:03.561 --> 20:04.635
The password?

20:04.635 --> 20:05.695
The water falls, the stone shows.

20:05.695 --> 20:07.263
Follow me.

21:35.495 --> 21:37.828
Sun Envoy, the man has arrived.

21:47.794 --> 21:49.128
How did he get in?

21:49.128 --> 21:50.495
Hua Chong brought him here.

21:50.495 --> 21:52.195
He used the name Shen Zhong Yuan.

21:52.195 --> 21:53.294
Shen Zhong Yuan?

21:53.294 --> 21:55.528
Gatekeepers found the name suspicious.

21:55.528 --> 21:56.995
But since you gave orders before,

21:56.995 --> 21:59.761
they tested his skills and let him in.

21:59.761 --> 22:01.671
Good, "Shen Zhong Yuan".

22:02.961 --> 22:04.294
What about the other one?

22:04.294 --> 22:06.128
He'll be here shortly.

22:06.128 --> 22:08.761
Good. All the guests will be here.

22:08.761 --> 22:10.521
Get everything ready.

22:29.628 --> 22:32.607
This is dangerous. Don't drink too much.

22:34.395 --> 22:36.428
Even like this, you still recognized me?

22:36.428 --> 22:38.628
Didn't you recognize me too?

22:38.628 --> 22:41.195
Was there anything unusual
in the embroidery shop's backyard?

22:41.195 --> 22:43.142
I didn't find anything fishy.

22:58.561 --> 23:01.361
They are really rare beauties.

23:01.361 --> 23:03.420
But I didn't see Yu Lian.

23:15.228 --> 23:16.761
What are you looking at?

23:16.761 --> 23:19.094
Look, that man with the limp.

23:19.094 --> 23:20.794
I've seen him before.

23:20.794 --> 23:22.395
When I was at Brother Liu's house,

23:22.395 --> 23:23.695
he was there too.

23:23.695 --> 23:26.294
Look how comfortable he is here.

23:26.294 --> 23:28.481
He must be a regular.

23:38.161 --> 23:42.126
Bravo!

24:06.607 --> 24:08.561
Tonight's bidding

24:08.561 --> 24:11.250
starts now!

24:29.075 --> 24:32.309
Bravo!

24:37.995 --> 24:41.340
Great!

24:44.728 --> 24:46.228
Yu Er.

24:46.228 --> 24:47.628
18 years old.

24:47.628 --> 24:48.895
From Suizhou.

24:48.895 --> 24:50.294
Skilled at the pipa.

24:50.294 --> 24:51.495
Starting price is

24:51.495 --> 24:53.594
30 taels of silver.

24:53.594 --> 24:55.507
- 40 taels!
- 50 taels!

24:55.507 --> 24:57.128
- 60 taels!
- 70 taels!

24:57.128 --> 24:59.233
- 80 taels!
- 90 taels!

24:59.233 --> 25:01.328
They're selling people like objects.

25:01.328 --> 25:02.995
- Those beasts.
- 100 taels!

25:02.995 --> 25:05.395
Do we just watch them harm these girls?

25:05.395 --> 25:07.028
110 taels!

25:07.028 --> 25:09.195
- 120 taels!
- That pill you gave Hua Chong,

25:09.195 --> 25:10.788
do you have any more?

25:10.788 --> 25:12.088
You're a fast learner.

25:12.088 --> 25:13.655
- I brought plenty.
- 130 taels!

25:13.655 --> 25:15.288
Enough to feed all these scoundrels.

25:15.288 --> 25:16.921
140 taels!

25:16.921 --> 25:19.528
150 taels!

25:26.921 --> 25:29.455
150 taels!

25:29.455 --> 25:31.888
Great!

25:45.888 --> 25:47.388
Get some information from that man.

25:47.388 --> 25:48.715
- For silver...
- Wait here.

25:48.715 --> 25:50.613
20 taels!

25:52.814 --> 25:54.554
30 taels!

25:54.554 --> 25:56.688
40 taels!

25:56.688 --> 25:58.475
50 taels!

25:58.475 --> 26:00.655
85 taels!

26:00.655 --> 26:01.721
100 taels!

26:01.721 --> 26:04.482
- Excuse me.
- 130 taels!

26:05.255 --> 26:06.815
140 taels!

26:06.815 --> 26:08.915
That girl Yu Er was truly beautiful.

26:08.915 --> 26:10.955
Why aren't you bidding?

26:10.955 --> 26:13.915
What's the rush? Just the first round.

26:13.915 --> 26:16.465
Is this your first time here?

26:18.275 --> 26:20.482
Please enlighten me.

26:23.848 --> 26:25.514
Three rounds of bidding every night.

26:25.514 --> 26:27.675
Three girls per round.

26:27.675 --> 26:29.915
Let me share my experience with you.

26:29.915 --> 26:33.155
If you see a girl you like, make your move.

26:33.155 --> 26:35.615
Don't think the girls in the later rounds
will be prettier.

26:35.615 --> 26:37.875
Those who come here aren't short on silver.

26:37.875 --> 26:40.300
They're just looking for excitement.

26:41.094 --> 26:45.094
I can tell you're a regular here.

26:45.094 --> 26:47.442
Have you heard of Yu Lian?

26:48.695 --> 26:51.361
I've heard people say she's a top-tier beauty.

26:51.361 --> 26:53.361
I came here specifically for her.

26:53.361 --> 26:55.428
Why hasn't she appeared yet?

26:55.428 --> 26:57.761
Is she in the later rounds?

26:57.761 --> 27:00.895
Please don't hold back on me.

27:00.895 --> 27:03.561
If she's as beautiful as you say,

27:03.561 --> 27:06.728
she must be taken by a gold medal holder.

27:06.728 --> 27:08.628
It doesn't matter how much silver you have.

27:08.628 --> 27:09.961
A gold medal holder?

27:09.961 --> 27:11.361
A gold medal holder

27:11.361 --> 27:13.561
has free rein here in Zhongxiao Pavilion.

27:13.561 --> 27:15.895
They can pick any girl they want.

27:15.895 --> 27:18.594
Even if the girl has already been won by you,

27:18.594 --> 27:20.294
once he shows that gold token,

27:20.294 --> 27:22.603
she must go with him.

27:24.495 --> 27:26.353
Thank you.

27:30.828 --> 27:31.961
How is it?

27:31.961 --> 27:34.094
- Is it him?
- It is his voice.

27:34.094 --> 27:37.761
I didn't expect Shao Ji Zu's medal
to be so powerful.

27:37.761 --> 27:39.328
We can't just stand here watching.

27:39.328 --> 27:40.915
We won't find out anything that way.

27:40.915 --> 27:42.480
I'll use the gold medal to bid for a girl
and question her.

27:42.480 --> 27:44.761
Maybe I can get some information.

27:44.761 --> 27:45.762
I'm thinking

27:45.762 --> 27:49.328
the token might have been too easy to take.

27:49.328 --> 27:51.308
If this gold medal is so powerful,

27:51.308 --> 27:53.361
there must be very few holders.

27:53.361 --> 27:54.715
Isn't it a bit too conspicuous

27:54.715 --> 27:57.028
using the gold token to get in?

27:57.028 --> 27:58.928
And that Shao Ji Zu,

27:58.928 --> 28:01.478
if he realizes what happened...

28:05.195 --> 28:08.695
My master invites you for a private meeting,
Master Shen.

28:12.075 --> 28:14.170
Please lead the way.

28:15.495 --> 28:18.853
Be careful. Know your limits.

28:21.520 --> 28:23.209
Bravo!

28:26.828 --> 28:28.628
Hui Dai.

28:28.628 --> 28:30.995
For silver,

28:30.995 --> 28:32.561
30 taels!

28:32.561 --> 28:33.895
30 taels!

28:33.895 --> 28:36.241
40 taels!

28:36.241 --> 28:38.080
45 taels!

28:38.080 --> 28:40.200
60 taels!

28:53.361 --> 28:54.528
Master Shen.

28:54.528 --> 28:55.561
The tea is ready.

28:55.561 --> 28:57.228
Please make yourself comfortable.

28:57.228 --> 28:59.656
My master will be here shortly.

29:27.094 --> 29:28.528
Why are you blindfolded?

29:28.528 --> 29:30.528
Take off that annoying veil.

29:30.528 --> 29:32.195
My Lord.

29:32.195 --> 29:33.895
It's the rule of Zhongxiao Pavilion.

29:33.895 --> 29:36.028
We are not allowed to remove our veils.

29:36.028 --> 29:37.361
What a stupid rule.

29:37.361 --> 29:39.597
I'm here. It's fine.

29:45.128 --> 29:46.395
Don't be afraid.

29:46.395 --> 29:47.794
I won't hurt you.

29:47.794 --> 29:50.151
I just want to ask you something.

29:50.961 --> 29:52.161
Have you seen

29:52.161 --> 29:53.794
a girl named Yu Lian?

29:53.794 --> 29:57.235
Who are you? Why are you looking for her?

29:57.235 --> 29:59.961
I was sent by her family to find her.

29:59.961 --> 30:01.901
Can you take her out of here?

30:02.528 --> 30:04.195
I'm afraid not yet.

30:04.195 --> 30:05.487
But in a little while,

30:05.487 --> 30:07.628
I will rescue all of you.

30:07.628 --> 30:09.128
So you must tell me first,

30:09.128 --> 30:11.301
where exactly is Yu Lian?

30:13.028 --> 30:14.328
Yu Lian

30:14.328 --> 30:16.828
doesn't join us for the bidding.

30:16.828 --> 30:19.153
She only stays with He Bo.

30:20.195 --> 30:21.561
Who is He Bo?

30:21.561 --> 30:23.955
He is the master of Zhongxiao Pavilion.

30:23.955 --> 30:24.961
However,

30:24.961 --> 30:26.961
none of us have ever seen his face.

30:26.961 --> 30:29.028
What does He Bo make Yu Lian do?

30:29.028 --> 30:30.714
I don't know.

30:30.714 --> 30:31.928
Yu Lian

30:31.928 --> 30:34.432
doesn't come to Zhongxiao Pavilion often.

30:35.761 --> 30:37.695
You just said

30:37.695 --> 30:40.326
you could rescue all of us.

30:40.326 --> 30:41.594
Is that true?

30:41.594 --> 30:42.895
Of course it's true.

30:42.895 --> 30:44.961
I keep my word.

30:44.961 --> 30:48.157
Your family is waiting to be reunited with you.

30:49.395 --> 30:50.995
After being in a place like this,

30:50.995 --> 30:53.161
even if I go back,

30:53.161 --> 30:55.128
people will gossip and point fingers,

30:55.128 --> 30:57.456
bringing shame to my family.

30:57.456 --> 30:58.880
If that's the case,

30:58.880 --> 31:00.594
I'd rather die.

31:00.594 --> 31:01.594
You're wrong.

31:01.594 --> 31:04.196
When Yu Lian's brother found out
she was in Zhongxiao Pavilion,

31:04.196 --> 31:07.361
all he did was to save her.

31:07.361 --> 31:09.195
It's the same for your family.

31:09.195 --> 31:10.360
In their hearts,

31:10.360 --> 31:11.628
reputation and honor

31:11.628 --> 31:14.017
are not as important as your life.

31:15.495 --> 31:16.880
Don't try to end your life.

31:16.880 --> 31:18.928
Wait for us to rescue you.

31:18.928 --> 31:21.094
Until then, if anyone selects you,

31:21.094 --> 31:22.695
give them this.

31:22.695 --> 31:23.895
What is this?

31:23.895 --> 31:25.695
Something good.

31:25.695 --> 31:27.228
If they eat this,

31:27.228 --> 31:28.835
they won't be in the mood to hurt you.

31:28.835 --> 31:31.987
There's plenty more here.
Share it with your sisters.

31:44.194 --> 31:46.042
You're not afraid of me anymore?

31:46.794 --> 31:48.392
No longer.

31:48.960 --> 31:51.200
I'll wait for you to rescue us.

31:52.710 --> 31:54.200
Hide.

32:20.528 --> 32:22.623
Shen Zhong Yuan.

32:28.761 --> 32:30.861
Where is Zhan Zhao?

32:30.861 --> 32:32.628
You can't even save yourself,

32:32.628 --> 32:34.801
yet you're worried about Zhan Zhao?

32:36.477 --> 32:38.211
Another masked man.

32:38.211 --> 32:40.600
Before we start fighting,

32:40.600 --> 32:43.040
could you let this lady leave first?

32:56.294 --> 32:59.294
Bai Yu Tang, the Jinmao Rat, you are famous.

32:59.294 --> 33:03.405
But I wonder how your skills compare
to the Southern Knight, Zhan Zhao.

33:29.928 --> 33:31.588
I'm busy saving people today.

33:31.588 --> 33:33.007
You can tell me another day

33:33.007 --> 33:34.722
which of us is better,

33:34.722 --> 33:36.977
me or that clumsy cat.

33:45.040 --> 33:46.727
Those hit by the Pili Palm

33:46.727 --> 33:48.195
must not force their internal energy,

33:48.195 --> 33:50.609
or they will damage their own meridians.

36:44.275 --> 36:45.361
Brother Shen...

36:45.361 --> 36:46.828
You idiot.

36:46.828 --> 36:48.441
He's familiar with the Shen style.

36:48.441 --> 36:51.655
You can't use your techniques to fight him.

38:22.094 --> 38:24.128
Zhan Zhao, Bai Yu Tang.

38:24.128 --> 38:25.675
Zhongxiao Pavilion

38:25.675 --> 38:28.020
is not a place where you come and go

38:28.020 --> 38:30.528
as you please.

38:30.528 --> 38:31.561
Zhan Zhao.

38:31.561 --> 38:35.435
Sounds like we're meant to die in here.

38:35.435 --> 38:38.653
You're not drunk. Stop talking so gloomily.

39:13.428 --> 39:14.823
You!

39:24.828 --> 39:26.594
That was a serious kick.

39:26.594 --> 39:28.608
Is your anger directed at him or at me?

39:28.608 --> 39:29.868
Need I say more?

39:29.868 --> 39:32.525
You couldn't even avoid a single arrow.

41:00.788 --> 41:03.654
So this is the famous Love Longing.

41:03.654 --> 41:04.720
Again!

41:04.720 --> 41:07.520
This is much more fun than ordinary weapons.

41:54.515 --> 41:57.547
You don't fear Love Longing's cold poison.

42:26.469 --> 42:27.600
You've suffered internal injuries.

42:27.600 --> 42:29.567
I'm fine. I just took a hit from the Pili Palm.

42:29.567 --> 42:31.395
True to form, Little Zhu.

42:31.395 --> 42:33.714
You used your inner energy
after being hit by the Pili Palm.

42:33.714 --> 42:35.455
Do you know the consequences?

42:35.455 --> 42:37.035
I adjusted my breathing
while I was hanging there.

42:37.035 --> 42:38.148
Why are you shouting?

42:38.148 --> 42:39.681
It'll be trouble if Zhi Hua hears you.

42:39.681 --> 42:40.955
Moon Envoy.

42:40.955 --> 42:42.840
If you cannot capture these two,

42:42.840 --> 42:46.520
I'll have everyone in Hanshui Palace
buried with them!

42:57.528 --> 43:00.548
Huo Ling Long, you've arrived just in time.

43:00.548 --> 43:01.915
Play to your strengths.

43:01.915 --> 43:03.114
Play with her.

43:03.114 --> 43:06.379
Miss Huo, be careful of Love Longing.
